The {{Term/Store|Sensor +||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref>{{Cite|It allows you to pinpoint the location of more than shrines—many more things. That's why it's called {{Color TotK|Red|sensor +}}!|Robbie|TotK}}</ref> also known as the {{Term/Store|Sheikah Sensor +||BotW, AoC}},{{Exp Game|BotW, AoC}}<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Sheikah Sensor +}}|N/A|BotW}}</ref>{{Name Ref|AoC}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
The Sheikah Sensor + is an upgrade for the [[Sheikah Sensor]] used to locate any unlocked [[Hyrule Compendium]] entries in {{BotW}}. It can be obtained from [[Purah]] by bringing her three [[Ancient Screw]]s during "[[Slated for Upgrades]]". Once it has been unlocked, [[Symin]] will ask to see the Sheikah Sensor +, and the "[[Sunshroom Sensing]]" [[Side Quest]] will become available.

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Stub|TotK}}
The Sensor + is an upgrade for the [[Sensor]] used to locate objects that have been registered in the [[Hyrule Compendium]]. It is obtained from [[Robbie]] at the [[Hateno Ancient Tech Lab]] during "[[Presenting: Sensor +!]]" after registering at least five [[Monster]]s in the Hyrule Compendium.

